<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups Stratus Computer.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups Stratus Computer.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs raised its rating on Stratus Computer Inc to trading buy from market perform, a Goldman source said Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
